    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Furnace of Renewal.</strong> You have tempered your body and spirit in heat meant to burn away rot.</p><ul><li>You gain <strong>resistance to poison and qliphothic damage (qliphothic)</strong>.</li><li>When creatures spend Body dice to heal during a short or a Soma Break while you are present and tending the campfire, forge, or ritual space, they regain an additional <strong>+2 Integrity per Hit Die</strong> spent (to a maximum per Soma Break equal to twice your Body modifier, at the GM’s discretion for large groups).</li></ul><p>Your resting places smell faintly of oil, incense, and quenched steel, and people wake feeling like they’ve had old rust scraped off the inside of their ribs.</p>",
